1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,630
So the monitor plane becomes a control plane.

2
00:00:02,630 --> 00:00:05,673
AgentReins holds the global repository tree,

3
00:00:05,673 --> 00:00:08,646
the call graph, and the live intent stream.

4
00:00:08,646 --> 00:00:12,240
It issues scoped task envelopes — scope, budget,

5
00:00:12,240 --> 00:00:15,684
gate — and Cursor, Codex and Workbuddy execute

6
00:00:15,684 --> 00:00:17,930
strictly inside that boundary.

7
00:00:17,930 --> 00:00:20,558
Every result flows back as evidence,

8
00:00:20,558 --> 00:00:22,018
and the loop closes.

9
00:00:22,018 --> 00:00:23,281
Same telemetry.

10
00:00:23,281 --> 00:00:24,401
New authority.
